1
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:59,200
"The Last Oath"

2
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:04,000
(Episode 24: Herin)

3
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:30,000
You're He Yao's brother?

4
00:01:34,708 --> 00:01:35,708
Aren't you already...

5
00:01:38,642 --> 00:01:39,976
I knew it.

6
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:42,041
All those videos He Yao
showed me were fake.

7
00:01:43,416 --> 00:01:44,416
What are you doing here?

8
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:48,625
You must be Lin Zai.

9
00:01:49,583 --> 00:01:50,916
I'm Shen Changhuan.

10
00:01:51,750 --> 00:01:52,750
I'm sorry

11
00:01:54,125 --> 00:01:55,958
we had to meet like this.

12
00:01:56,916 --> 00:01:57,916
Forgive me.

13
00:01:58,500 --> 00:01:59,916
He Yao lied to you.

14
00:02:02,708 --> 00:02:04,291
Everything he did to you

15
00:02:05,208 --> 00:02:06,583
was because of me.

16
00:02:09,958 --> 00:02:11,208
What on earth is going on?

17
00:02:14,166 --> 00:02:15,541
After the outbreak,

18
00:02:16,750 --> 00:02:18,583
we wanted to develop a vaccine together.

19
00:02:19,916 --> 00:02:21,208
I wanted to beat him

20
00:02:22,583 --> 00:02:24,041
and prove myself.

21
00:02:25,958 --> 00:02:27,208
So behind his back,

22
00:02:29,750 --> 00:02:30,750
I used myself

23
00:02:31,458 --> 00:02:33,250
as the first human test subject.

24
00:02:37,416 --> 00:02:38,416
I never expected

25
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,958
to end up like this.

26
00:02:42,333 --> 00:02:44,583
A half-human, half-zombie monster.

27
00:02:47,750 --> 00:02:48,750
He Yao...

28
00:02:49,208 --> 00:02:50,833
He Yao refused to give up on me.

29
00:02:51,791 --> 00:02:52,791
That's why...

30
00:02:52,916 --> 00:02:54,165
So right from the start,

31
00:02:54,166 --> 00:02:55,791
you weren't a real zombie.

32
00:03:02,625 --> 00:03:04,125
Even so,

33
00:03:04,833 --> 00:03:07,416
He Yao had no right to use
my brother to deceive me.

34
00:03:10,500 --> 00:03:11,500
I'm sorry.

35
00:03:12,208 --> 00:03:13,416
I'm truly sorry.

36
00:03:15,125 --> 00:03:16,916
He Yao wasn't like this before.

37
00:03:20,041 --> 00:03:21,375
He was the best person.

38
00:03:22,625 --> 00:03:24,750
I've ever known in this world.

39
00:03:25,750 --> 00:03:26,750
It was me.

40
00:03:27,791 --> 00:03:30,125
I'm the one who turned him into this.

41
00:03:30,916 --> 00:03:32,250
It's all my fault.

42
00:03:34,375 --> 00:03:35,833
I know.

43
00:03:37,250 --> 00:03:38,833
I know he wronged you all.

44
00:03:39,416 --> 00:03:40,416
What he's done

45
00:03:41,416 --> 00:03:42,416
is unforgivable.

46
00:03:43,625 --> 00:03:44,625
But...

47
00:03:44,833 --> 00:03:46,000
I beg you.

48
00:03:46,750 --> 00:03:48,291
I'm begging you, please.

49
00:03:49,416 --> 00:03:50,958
Everything he owes you,

50
00:03:51,791 --> 00:03:52,916
I'll pay it back.

51
00:03:54,041 --> 00:03:55,041
What do you mean?

52
00:03:55,416 --> 00:03:56,416
I...

53
00:03:59,541 --> 00:03:59,958
You...

54
00:03:59,958 --> 00:04:00,958
What's wrong with you?

55
00:04:19,916 --> 00:04:20,916
You're awake?

56
00:04:21,750 --> 00:04:22,750
Just in time.

57
00:04:23,125 --> 00:04:24,125
Just wait.

58
00:04:24,583 --> 00:04:26,000
It's all over now.

59
00:04:32,250 --> 00:04:33,610
You want to take us down with you?

60
00:04:34,625 --> 00:04:35,625
You lunatic!

61
00:04:36,208 --> 00:04:37,916
What good does this do you?

62
00:04:44,298 --> 00:04:45,298
Wrong.

63
00:04:45,583 --> 00:04:46,958
Changhuan is gone.

64
00:04:47,083 --> 00:04:48,416
If you hadn't been
guarding that immune carrier

65
00:04:48,440 --> 00:04:50,274
like a rabid dog and getting in my way,

66
00:04:50,375 --> 00:04:51,855
Changhuan would've been cured by now!

67
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,000
It was you!

68
00:04:53,541 --> 00:04:54,916
You ruined everything!

69
00:04:55,375 --> 00:04:57,583
You made me lose the person
who mattered most to me!

70
00:04:58,416 --> 00:05:00,336
Now I'll make the person
who matters most to you

71
00:05:00,583 --> 00:05:02,541
watch you burn alive!

72
00:05:06,458 --> 00:05:07,458
What fire?

73
00:05:08,375 --> 00:05:09,815
There are innocent people out there!

74
00:05:15,416 --> 00:05:17,456
You're afraid of dragging
Lin Zai into this, right?

75
00:05:19,208 --> 00:05:20,833
Even if he doesn't burn to death,

76
00:05:21,375 --> 00:05:23,083
he won't survive anyway.

77
00:05:24,375 --> 00:05:25,500
What do you mean?

78
00:05:30,833 --> 00:05:31,833
Herin?

79
00:05:32,916 --> 00:05:34,082
You led them here?

80
00:05:34,083 --> 00:05:35,083
Yes.

81
00:05:35,125 --> 00:05:36,375
I led them here.

82
00:05:36,583 --> 00:05:38,223
Their main force will be here any minute.

83
00:05:38,791 --> 00:05:39,916
He can't hide anymore.

84
00:05:41,208 --> 00:05:43,083
You're out of your damn mind!

85
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:57,083
You can all die with Changhuan!

86
00:06:10,166 --> 00:06:11,582
Fire! There's a fire over there!

87
00:06:11,583 --> 00:06:12,708
It's the lab!

88
00:06:13,291 --> 00:06:14,500
The lab is on fire!

89
00:06:15,541 --> 00:06:16,541
Brother!

90
00:06:17,583 --> 00:06:18,583
Brother!

91
00:06:19,208 --> 00:06:20,000
Fire!

92
00:06:20,001 --> 00:06:21,500
Fire! It's on fire!

93
00:06:39,291 --> 00:06:40,582
Help! Fire!

94
00:06:40,583 --> 00:06:41,583
Out of the way!

95
00:06:43,333 --> 00:06:44,333
Is anyone in there?

96
00:06:44,916 --> 00:06:46,375
A-Leh! A-Leh!

97
00:06:46,625 --> 00:06:48,375
He Yao, are you guys in there?

98
00:06:49,708 --> 00:06:50,458
Lin Zai!

99
00:06:50,625 --> 00:06:51,583
Stay back! Don't come in!

100
00:06:51,583 --> 00:06:52,583
Look.

101
00:06:53,375 --> 00:06:54,958
He's here to die with you.

102
00:06:56,708 --> 00:06:58,000
He's going to live.

103
00:06:58,333 --> 00:06:59,333
Answer me!

104
00:06:59,625 --> 00:07:01,305
And I'm going to live right alongside him.

105
00:07:01,416 --> 00:07:02,416
A-Leh!

106
00:07:06,375 --> 00:07:07,375
Let me!

107
00:07:11,958 --> 00:07:12,958
A-Leh!

108
00:07:22,291 --> 00:07:23,291
Get out of here, now!

109
00:07:28,041 --> 00:07:29,041
Changhuan?

110
00:07:29,541 --> 00:07:30,583
Is that you?

111
00:07:32,041 --> 00:07:33,541
Have you come to take me away?

112
00:07:44,708 --> 00:07:45,916
Changhuan!

113
00:07:46,250 --> 00:07:47,333
It really is you!

114
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:49,000
You're not dead!

115
00:07:49,166 --> 00:07:50,166
You're still alive!

116
00:07:53,125 --> 00:07:54,333
Let's get out of here!

117
00:08:20,458 --> 00:08:21,708
Changhuan...

118
00:08:30,250 --> 00:08:31,250
Why did you...

119
00:09:12,625 --> 00:09:13,625
Brother...

120
00:09:14,708 --> 00:09:15,916
It's over.

121
00:09:17,541 --> 00:09:18,750
Let's go home.

122
00:10:52,708 --> 00:10:53,583
I never thought

123
00:10:53,584 --> 00:10:54,875
it would end so tragically.

124
00:10:59,541 --> 00:11:00,666
What's on your mind?

125
00:11:01,750 --> 00:11:03,291
This isn't over yet.

126
00:11:03,750 --> 00:11:05,510
The Organization's
main force is on its way.

127
00:11:07,625 --> 00:11:09,265
Are they really sending that many people?

128
00:11:09,750 --> 00:11:10,208
Yeah.

129
00:11:10,625 --> 00:11:12,333
They won't let this go easily.

130
00:11:13,666 --> 00:11:15,041
Then let's leave together.

131
00:11:15,916 --> 00:11:16,916
I'm staying behind

132
00:11:17,083 --> 00:11:18,416
to stall them as long as I can.

133
00:11:18,541 --> 00:11:19,291
You guys fall back first.

134
00:11:19,292 --> 00:11:20,666
I'll find a chance to break away.

135
00:11:24,708 --> 00:11:25,832
If we leave, we leave together.

136
00:11:25,833 --> 00:11:26,993
If we stay, we stay together.

137
00:11:27,458 --> 00:11:28,833
I won't slow you down.

138
00:11:31,208 --> 00:11:32,666
I can't let you take that risk.

139
00:11:33,291 --> 00:11:35,291
And I'm supposed to just
watch you risk your life?

140
00:11:38,041 --> 00:11:39,041
This is how

141
00:11:39,333 --> 00:11:40,708
I've always lived my life.

142
00:11:43,500 --> 00:11:45,083
But you have me now.

143
00:11:45,291 --> 00:11:46,625
What did you tell me before?

144
00:11:46,708 --> 00:11:47,875
You said you and I...

145
00:11:48,208 --> 00:11:49,416
Have you forgotten already?

146
00:11:56,625 --> 00:11:57,625
Alright.

147
00:11:59,708 --> 00:12:00,708
We leave together.

148
00:12:41,750 --> 00:12:42,750
I'm counting on you guys.

149
00:12:53,833 --> 00:12:54,833
A-Leh?

150
00:12:57,416 --> 00:12:58,416
Brother Dao.

151
00:12:58,875 --> 00:12:59,916
Don't worry.

152
00:13:00,166 --> 00:13:01,915
I'll take good care of Lin Zai

153
00:13:01,916 --> 00:13:03,041
until you regroup with us.

154
00:13:05,166 --> 00:13:06,166
Thanks a lot.

155
00:13:06,166 --> 00:13:07,166
Take care.

156
00:13:11,125 --> 00:13:12,083
I looted all of these

157
00:13:12,084 --> 00:13:14,041
off their bodies.

158
00:13:14,166 --> 00:13:15,333
You keep them all.

159
00:13:20,708 --> 00:13:21,828
Keep one for yourselves too.

160
00:13:27,916 --> 00:13:29,083
Watch your back.

161
00:13:31,333 --> 00:13:32,333
Let's go.

162
00:17:31,666 --> 00:17:32,707
Leh Ri!

163
00:17:32,708 --> 00:17:33,828
There's nowhere left to run!

164
00:17:35,833 --> 00:17:37,083
Hand over the immune carrier,

165
00:17:37,625 --> 00:17:38,875
and we'll spare your life.

166
00:17:55,708 --> 00:17:56,708
A-Leh!

167
00:17:58,416 --> 00:17:59,416
Lin Zai?

168
00:18:10,875 --> 00:18:12,666
I'm the immune carrier you're looking for!

169
00:18:14,041 --> 00:18:15,401
If any of you lay a finger on him,

170
00:18:15,708 --> 00:18:17,083
I'll blow us all to pieces!

171
00:18:27,875 --> 00:18:28,875
Leh Ri,

172
00:18:29,125 --> 00:18:30,833
this is the Organization's final offer.

173
00:18:31,083 --> 00:18:32,540
Hand over the immune carrier,

174
00:18:32,541 --> 00:18:33,624
and the Organization will...

175
00:18:33,625 --> 00:18:34,916
Screw Leh Ri!

176
00:18:36,541 --> 00:18:37,833
His damn name is Gao Liang!

177
00:20:12,708 --> 00:20:13,708
Are you hurt?

178
00:20:17,666 --> 00:20:18,666
That bomb...

179
00:20:19,083 --> 00:20:20,083
Was it real?

180
00:20:22,125 --> 00:20:23,416
I was just bluffing.

181
00:20:23,791 --> 00:20:24,791
Look.

182
00:20:30,083 --> 00:20:31,083
Still,

183
00:20:31,291 --> 00:20:32,291
A-Leh,

184
00:20:32,541 --> 00:20:33,821
when it comes to protecting you,

185
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:35,041
I'm dead serious.

186
00:20:40,416 --> 00:20:41,833
Aren't you going to call me...

187
00:20:42,666 --> 00:20:43,750
Gao Liang anymore?

188
00:20:46,166 --> 00:20:47,332
It sounds too corny.

189
00:20:47,333 --> 00:20:48,916
I'm still used to calling you A-Leh.

190
00:20:52,916 --> 00:20:54,156
We're pretty much done packing.

191
00:20:54,375 --> 00:20:56,166
We've got way more firepower now.

192
00:20:57,083 --> 00:20:58,083
Let's roll.

193
00:21:09,041 --> 00:21:10,041
A-Leh.

194
00:21:11,666 --> 00:21:12,666
You guys...

195
00:21:13,541 --> 00:21:14,541
Brother Dao,

196
00:21:15,250 --> 00:21:16,875
we won't be coming with you.

197
00:21:18,333 --> 00:21:19,458
I won't forget

198
00:21:19,875 --> 00:21:20,958
what you've done for us.

199
00:21:24,375 --> 00:21:25,541
Don't mention it.

200
00:21:26,125 --> 00:21:27,500
I owed you my life.

201
00:21:27,666 --> 00:21:28,875
Now we're even.

202
00:21:30,041 --> 00:21:31,361
You guys take care of yourselves.

203
00:21:31,416 --> 00:21:32,708
I'm sure

204
00:21:33,250 --> 00:21:34,333
we'll meet again someday.

205
00:21:37,416 --> 00:21:38,416
Stay safe on the road.

206
00:21:42,708 --> 00:21:43,708
Let's go.

207
00:21:51,666 --> 00:21:52,875
Hey, kid.

208
00:21:53,333 --> 00:21:55,053
Remember to take care of yourself, alright?

209
00:21:55,375 --> 00:21:57,374
Who knows, maybe one of these days,

210
00:21:57,375 --> 00:21:58,666
we'll run into each other again.

211
00:21:59,916 --> 00:22:00,833
Sister Chen,

212
00:22:00,834 --> 00:22:02,958
please take good care
of Grandma Qiu for me.

213
00:22:03,041 --> 00:22:04,041
I will.

214
00:22:04,708 --> 00:22:05,708
A-Leh,

215
00:22:05,709 --> 00:22:07,458
I'm leaving Lin Zai in your hands.

216
00:22:11,958 --> 00:22:12,958
We're off.

217
00:22:22,375 --> 00:22:23,375
Pulling this stunt again?

218
00:22:37,958 --> 00:22:38,958
Brother,

219
00:22:40,541 --> 00:22:42,125
before you left, you told me

220
00:22:42,541 --> 00:22:43,708
to live a good life.

221
00:22:46,833 --> 00:22:48,291
Back then, I was merely surviving.

222
00:22:55,083 --> 00:22:56,416
Now,

223
00:22:57,541 --> 00:22:59,250
I've found a new purpose.

224
00:24:41,500 --> 00:24:43,125
Where are we going?

225
00:24:45,458 --> 00:24:46,538
It's a big world out there.

226
00:24:46,791 --> 00:24:47,958
As long as we're together,

227
00:24:48,250 --> 00:24:49,250
anywhere is fine by me.
